#: applications/luci-app-wwand/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wwand/modems.js:370
msgid ""
"This SIM is PUK-locked (%s). A WRONG PUK consumes one of ~10 attempts — "
"after the last one the SIM is permanently destroyed. The PUK is printed on "
"the SIM carrier or available from the provider."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-wwand/htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:267
msgid "This card is managed by %s. Profile changes are made there, not here."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-wwand/htdocs/luci-static/resources/wwand/esim.js:241
msgid ""
"This is the normal behaviour of M2M eUICCs (SGP.02) and of vendor-locked "
"cards: profiles are managed over-the-air by the SIM provider (SM-SR), so "
"downloading or switching profiles from this router is not possible. Use the "
"provider’s portal to manage the card — the router only needs to keep the "
"active profile registered and online."
msgstr ""

